{
  "sn45.98-102:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 45.98–102 ",
  "sn45.98-102:0.2": "9. Gaṅgāpeyyālavagga ",
  "sn45.98-102:0.3": "Dutiyādisamuddaninnasuttapañcaka ",
  "sn45.98-102:1.1": "“Seyyathāpi, bhikkhave, yamunā nadī samuddaninnā samuddapoṇā samuddapabbhārā; ",
  "sn45.98-102:1.2": "evameva kho, bhikkhave, bhikkhu …pe… ",
  "sn45.98-102:1.3": "seyyathāpi, bhikkhave, aciravatī nadī samuddaninnā samuddapoṇā samuddapabbhārā; ",
  "sn45.98-102:1.4": "evameva kho, bhikkhave, bhikkhu …pe… ",
  "sn45.98-102:1.5": "seyyathāpi, bhikkhave, sarabhū nadī samuddaninnā samuddapoṇā samuddapabbhārā; ",
  "sn45.98-102:1.6": "evameva kho, bhikkhave, bhikkhu …pe… ",
  "sn45.98-102:1.7": "seyyathāpi, bhikkhave, mahī nadī samuddaninnā samuddapoṇā samuddapabbhārā; ",
  "sn45.98-102:1.8": "evameva kho, bhikkhave, bhikkhu …pe… ",
  "sn45.98-102:1.9": "seyyathāpi, bhikkhave, yā kācimā mahānadiyo, seyyathidaṁ—",
  "sn45.98-102:1.10": "gaṅgā, yamunā, aciravatī, sarabhū, mahī, sabbā tā samuddaninnā samuddapoṇā samuddapabbhārā; ",
  "sn45.98-102:1.11": "evameva kho, bhikkhave, bhikkhu ariyaṁ aṭṭhaṅgikaṁ maggaṁ bhāvento ariyaṁ aṭṭhaṅgikaṁ maggaṁ bahulīkaronto nibbānaninno hoti nibbānapoṇo nibbānapabbhāro. ",
  "sn45.98-102:1.12": "Kathañca, bhikkhave, bhikkhu ariyaṁ aṭṭhaṅgikaṁ maggaṁ bhāvento ariyaṁ aṭṭhaṅgikaṁ maggaṁ bahulīkaronto nibbānaninno hoti nibbānapoṇo nibbānapabbhāro? ",
  "sn45.9